    "1": {
      "note": "The Investigator starts taskless in Projects, on a sprint, on a standalone master, or on both, never on a leaf; its concern arrives in its parent's first `role_message` (or from the developer in own chat when parentless), and missing concern, IDs or repos are asked for, never invented.\n\nAnchor: `role_message`",
