    "3": {
      "note": "The role directs opening available saved briefs before its source work. Compact rows can give applicable card status and a brief pointer with saved freshness. Fuller replies can include rule text. `knowledge_read` retrieves text-bearing views (`impact`, `search`, `records`, and `dependent`) paired with the code tree.",
